ct rule. NULL means no usable predecessor; this is distinct from three-candle CDL3INSIDE and is not breakout direction or probability.','CALCULATION_VERIFIED',ARRAY['features/feature04/tests/test_engine.py','verification/feature04/FULL_BACKFILL.md','FEATURE04_TECHNICAL_INDICATOR.md']::text[]);
